2. Samuel E. Escobar, The new global mission: the gospel from everywhere to everyone (Downers Grove: IVP Academic, 2003), p. 19-20.

3. John Inazu, “Do black lives matter to evangelicals?”, Washington Post, January 6, 2016.

4. Melinda Lundquist Denton; Christian Smith, Soul searching: the religious and spiritual lives of American teenagers (Oxford: Oxford University Press, 2005).

